              "text": "I'm aware you've been having some quiet chats lately. That's fine — no one is in trouble, and nothing needs to change between us. I'd rather we all stay open with each other than have arrangements form in the dark. If you'd prefer, we can keep things cordial and clear going forward. My door is open."
