              "speaker": "Borin",
              "text": "Appreciate the even-handedness, Aurelia. I'll keep things straightforward on my end — nothing to hide. And I'm glad the door stays open; I'd only ask it swings both ways from time to time."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Aurelia",
              "text": "Fair enough — the door swings both ways, as long as it's used honestly. I'll be open with you when it matters, and I expect the same in return. Keep it straightforward and we'll have no problems."
